From b5ea0192d496d38d93df608f4eefbae57287fec2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ahmed JARRAYA <ahmed.jarraya@softathome.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Nov 2025 16:00:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] pWHM: changing TransmitPower value has no impact on txpower
 from iw info

Problem:
- modifying the value of TransmitPower doesnt
impact the value of txpower retrieved via iw info

Fix:
- use the index of the first active interface.
- add linkid to nl80211 NL80211_CMD_SET_WIPHY call
when setting radio Tx Power.

Closes: PPW-331
Signed-off-by: Ahmed JARRAYA <ahmed.jarraya@softathome.com>
Signed-off-by: Jestin John Mathew <jestin-john.mathew_ext@softathome.com>
---
 include/wld/wld_nl80211_api.h | 55 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/wld/wld_rad_nl80211.h | 12 ++++++
 src/nl80211/wld_nl80211_api.c | 41 ++++++++++++++++----
 src/nl80211/wld_rad_nl80211.c | 70 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 4 files changed, 158 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/wld/wld_nl80211_api.h b/include/wld/wld_nl80211_api.h
index bffd7a897..654f5dd17 100644
